  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'You are a fortune teller. Each night, three customers come to you, and the game lasts three nights - nine readings in all.

    In each reading you draw cards to build up the customer''s fortune. Draw too greedily and the reading falls apart. Knowing when to stop is everything.

    Your final score is the total of all nine readings. Each night also has a target score: missing it does not end the game, but reaching it earns you 2 Spirit.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dfdfbb81a1e632e4e943931cba6a0c09, type: 2}
