      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Only the one who stops <b>last</b> can get the Foresight Bonus. If you stop first, your score is fixed right away and no card is turned over.

    Wait until the CPU has stopped or broken, then stop: the next card is turned over, and if it is unlucky, your score is multiplied by 1.5.

    If the deck runs out, anyone still reading is scored without the bonus.'
